---

The NASA C-MAPSS Turbofan Engine Degradation Simulation dataset is NOT
redistributed by this repository. Raw dataset files are excluded via .gitignore
(only data/raw/README.md and data/.checksums.txt are tracked); users must obtain
the official dataset separately and place it under data/raw/CMAPSSData_v1.0/ as
described in the README. The dataset remains the work of its authors; if you use
it in derived work, please cite:

Saxena, A., Goebel, K., Simon, D., & Eklund, N. (2008). Damage Propagation
Modeling for Aircraft Engine Run-to-Failure Simulation. Proceedings of the
1st International Conference on Prognostics and Health Management, Denver, CO.
